{
  "slug": "mister-anderson",
  "name": "Mister Anderson",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Beads development for humans — a structured, human-controlled development pipeline with task tracking, code review gates, and multi-agent orchestration",
  "longDescription": "Ships **19 skills**, **8 agents** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (19): `add-supervisor` (Create a new implementation supervisor for a specific technology), `architecture` (Create high-level product architecture — system design, tech stack, structural decisions), `do` (Dispatch the implementation supervisor for a bead task), `implementation` (Stage 3 orchestrator — guides Implementation for a phase: shows task progress, routes through investigate → do →…), `investigate` (Dispatch codebase investigation for a bead task), `manifesto` (Guide the creation of a product manifesto — vision, principles, and governing laws that shape all downstream decisions), `plan` (Create a phase/feature plan that scopes work, defines high-level tasks, and identifies dependencies), `product` (Stage 1 orchestrator — guides Product Discovery: manifesto → requirements → architecture), and 11 more\n- **Agents** (8): `architect` (System design and implementation planning), `beads-owner` (Expert product owner), `code-reviewer` (Read-only code review gate), `discovery` (Tech stack detection and supervisor creation), `investigator` (Technical feasibility research and assumption validation), `product-manager` (Transforms raw ideas into structured PRDs through guided discovery, user research, and product strategy frameworks), `qa-gate` (Quality assurance finalization gate), `research` (Codebase investigation and root cause analysis)\n- **Hooks** (2): `PreToolUse`, `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mister-anderson@claude-community` from `websublime/mister-anderson`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
